WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.969 --> 00:00:14.535
The fire alarm rang loudly.

2
00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.796
Mr. Chin spun toward Ben.

3
00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.698
"Is this a real emergency?"

4
00:00:20.798 --> 00:00:21.879
Remembering that Mr.

5
00:00:21.959 --> 00:00:26.342
Gwarg had led the safety patrol officers away earlier, Ben shook his head.

6
00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:28.203
"It must be a safety drill."

7
00:00:28.723 --> 00:00:30.284
Mog came rushing toward them.

8
00:00:31.048 --> 00:00:32.770
"This is not a drill!"

9
00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:33.590
he said.

10
00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:36.292
"There's a fire in the cafeteria.

11
00:00:36.533 --> 00:00:37.393
Follow me!"

12
00:00:38.154 --> 00:00:41.837
Mog led them to some stairs, and they quickly exited the school.

13
00:00:43.138 --> 00:00:45.660
Mr. Chin scanned the crowd outside the building.

14
00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.442
"Where's my daughter?"

15
00:00:48.462 --> 00:00:51.365
"I'm sure she's fine," Ben said.

16
00:00:51.865 --> 00:00:55.408
He watched anxiously as monsters and people hurried outside.

17
00:00:56.229 --> 00:00:58.110
Mr. Chin rolled up his sleeves.

18
00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.912
"I'm going back in for her."

19
00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:02.861
"I think you should stay here, Mr.

20
00:01:02.922 --> 00:01:04.263
Chin," Mog said.

21
00:01:04.283 --> 00:01:06.224
"That's the safest thing to do.

22
00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.926
There are other adults inside the building.

23
00:01:09.187 --> 00:01:10.708
They'll make sure everyone gets out."

24
00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:12.930
A moment later Mr.

25
00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:15.872
Chin's daughter ran out of the school with another human girl.

26
00:01:15.892 --> 00:01:18.414
"Daddy!" she cried.

27
00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:22.878
"Phew!" Ben thought.

28
00:01:23.358 --> 00:01:25.160
In the distance he heard sirens.

29
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.882
The Monsterville Fire Department was on its way.

30
00:01:28.323 --> 00:01:29.624
Winnie ran over to Ben.

31
00:01:30.964 --> 00:01:32.045
"Have you seen Cleo?"

32
00:01:33.005 --> 00:01:34.006
Ben shook his head.

33
00:01:34.026 --> 00:01:36.427
"She took Dave's mom to the cafeteria.

34
00:01:36.887 --> 00:01:38.688
Mog said that's where the fire started.

35
00:01:39.028 --> 00:01:39.969
I hope they're okay."

36
00:01:40.429 --> 00:01:41.490
Winnie bit her lip.

37
00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:42.630
"Me too."

38
00:01:43.711 --> 00:01:48.173
Just as the Monsterville fire trucks appeared, Jen ran out of the school building.

39
00:01:48.533 --> 00:01:50.775
Cleo and Dave's mom were right behind her.

40
00:01:50.795 --> 00:01:53.656
"Don't worry, everybody!"

41
00:01:53.996 --> 00:01:54.757
Jen called.

42
00:01:54.777 --> 00:01:56.858
"Everyone is out of the building."

43
00:01:56.878 --> 00:02:00.680
"Yay!" Monsters and people cheered.

44
00:02:01.248 --> 00:02:04.511
The cafeteria trolls came outside with fire extinguishers.

45
00:02:04.531 --> 00:02:06.552
"The fire's out!"

46
00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:07.613
one said.

47
00:02:07.633 --> 00:02:12.797
"That's great news," the Monsterville fire chief said.

48
00:02:12.817 --> 00:02:15.920
"But we'll check the building, just to make sure that it's safe."

49
00:02:19.583 --> 00:02:20.984
Dave's mother looked upset.

50
00:02:21.004 --> 00:02:26.148
"I should have known better than to test the stove burners.

51
00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:32.023
It wasn't necessary, and I didn't expect such huge flames to leap up."

52
00:02:33.843 --> 00:02:36.344
A cafeteria troll gave her a stern look.

53
00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:39.826
"Monster stoves use dragon fire.

54
00:02:40.246 --> 00:02:41.927
They're not for people."

55
00:02:41.947 --> 00:02:45.409
"Nobody got hurt."

56
00:02:45.749 --> 00:02:46.969
Cleo reassured Mrs.

57
00:02:47.029 --> 00:02:49.931
Wharton. "And the fire never got out of control."

58
00:02:50.611 --> 00:02:52.392
Mr. Freaky wiped his forehead.

59
00:02:53.644 --> 00:02:58.748
"Everything is always totally under control at Monster Academy!"

60
00:02:58.768 --> 00:03:04.192
"Especially now that we have a safety patrol," Mr.

61
00:03:04.252 --> 00:03:04.993
Gwarg added.

62
00:03:05.013 --> 00:03:11.297
"Well, I'm glad you monsters know a thing or two about safety," Dave's mom said.

63
00:03:16.721 --> 00:03:19.824
I didn't know blobs could move so quickly.

64
00:03:21.076 --> 00:03:24.297
Jen did a fantastic job of evacuating the school."

65
00:03:25.657 --> 00:03:26.458
"Thank you."

66
00:03:27.358 --> 00:03:28.638
Jen grinned proudly.

67
00:03:29.479 --> 00:03:32.199
Even Mayor Hubbletree looked impressed as he clapped Mr.

68
00:03:32.259 --> 00:03:33.280
Freaky on the back.

69
00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:38.601
"Freaky, you monsters might be better at safety procedures than we humans are."

70
00:03:39.762 --> 00:03:41.202
"Why, thank you, Mayor.

71
00:03:41.622 --> 00:03:43.203
Have you seen our safety handbook?"

72
00:03:44.883 --> 00:03:47.884
He waved Jen over and asked her to show it to the mayor.

73
00:03:53.168 --> 00:03:54.289
"It's terrific."

74
00:03:55.009 --> 00:03:55.830
Ben laughed.

75
00:03:58.071 --> 00:04:02.453
"I'm not sure that old handbook is going to impress the humans," he said to Winnie.

76
00:04:02.473 --> 00:04:08.937
"Nope, but maybe our decorations will—unless some of them got scorched in the fire."

77
00:04:08.957 --> 00:04:11.758
"Hey, look who's here!"

78
00:04:12.219 --> 00:04:13.339
Mog suddenly shouted.

79
00:04:13.959 --> 00:04:16.681
Ben turned to see a car pull up in front of the school.

80
00:04:18.402 --> 00:04:21.484
The driver let out a passenger who was walking with crutches.

81
00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:23.761
"Mr. Bog!"

82
00:04:24.101 --> 00:04:24.762
Ben cried.

83
00:04:25.362 --> 00:04:27.504
The custodian limped over to the group.

84
00:04:27.524 --> 00:04:31.607
"What's everybody doing out here?"

85
00:04:33.709 --> 00:04:36.151
Ben told him about the cafeteria fire.

86
00:04:36.171 --> 00:04:39.474
"Whoa!" Mr.

87
00:04:39.514 --> 00:04:40.114
Bog said.

88
00:04:40.134 --> 00:04:44.538
"I've only been gone a few days, and Monster Academy nearly burned down!"

89
00:04:45.519 --> 00:04:47.921
A tiny witch threw her arms around his leg.

90
00:04:47.941 --> 00:04:50.323
"I missed you so much, Mr.

91
00:04:51.912 --> 00:04:52.192
Bog!" Mr.

92
00:04:52.272 --> 00:04:53.913
Freaky threw his arms around Mr.

93
00:04:53.973 --> 00:04:54.554
Bog too.

94
00:04:54.574 --> 00:04:57.535
"I missed you more!"

95
00:04:58.316 --> 00:05:00.837
Mr. Bog looked embarrassed as he patted Mr.

96
00:05:00.897 --> 00:05:01.777
Freaky's shoulder.

97
00:05:01.797 --> 00:05:03.538
"There, there, Mr.

98
00:05:03.598 --> 00:05:08.681
Freaky. You didn't think I'd let a busted leg keep me away from the sleepover, did you?

99
00:05:09.822 --> 00:05:11.903
I've been looking forward to it all week."

100
00:05:12.983 --> 00:05:17.586
"Thanks to the safety patrol, everything turned out all right," Mr.

101
00:05:17.646 --> 00:05:18.746
Gwarg said proudly.

102
00:05:18.766 --> 00:05:22.568
"Everything but my brownies," Cleo said.

103
00:05:22.588 --> 00:05:26.090
"In all the excitement, I'm afraid they got burned.

104
00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:35.133
But there are plenty of other snacks—grilled bat wings, slime cakes, fried amoebas Cleo stopped talking as the

105
00:05:35.214 --> 00:05:37.174
color drained from the people's faces.

106
00:05:37.815 --> 00:05:39.055
Ben broke the silence.

107
00:05:39.715 --> 00:05:42.456
"We also have potato chips, soda, and pizza."

108
00:05:42.476 --> 00:05:46.618
"The kind of pizza that people eat," Winnie quickly added.

109
00:05:46.638 --> 00:05:49.259
"Oh, good!"

110
00:05:49.699 --> 00:05:50.720
a human kid said.

111
00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:56.803
As everyone began drifting back into the building, Dave's mother came over to Ben.

112
00:05:56.823 --> 00:06:03.108
"Thank you for welcoming us so warmly to Monster Academy," she said.

113
00:06:03.128 --> 00:06:08.252
"I had some doubts at first, but it's actually a very nice school."

114
00:06:08.272 --> 00:06:12.154
"It sure is," Ben said with a smile.

115
00:06:12.775 --> 00:06:14.756
Then he zipped off to catch up with Winnie.

116
00:06:15.657 --> 00:06:19.360
They'd worked hard all week—it was time for the fun to begin.
